## Why This Is Asked
The question probes design skills for cost-aware, multi-tenant telemetry at scale with tenancy isolation and latency SLAs.

## Key Concepts
- Multi-path ingest by priority
- Real-time downsampling strategies
- Per-tenant partitioning and access control
- OpenTelemetry correlation for latency visibility
- Cost governance via TTL, budgets, and lifecycle

## Code Example
```javascript
// Pseudo: decide whether to sample a record for a tenant
function shouldSample(priority, tenantId, rate) {
  // priority: 'high' or 'low'; rate: 0<rate<=1; return boolean
  if (priority === 'high') return false;
  // simple hash-based sampling per tenant
  const h = hash(tenantId) % Math.floor(1/rate);
  return h !== 0;
}
```

